# Exits on a zone master room and global exits in the master room (src/game.c process_command remote_exit and
# global_exit; src/move.c move_wrapper). A typed exit name and `goto` try the room's own exits, then the zone master
# room's, then the master room's. Rooms are found by name with lsearch(), never by literal dbref. The Lab
# builds them, so no creation message names a dbref: the reference reuses a number an earlier scenario freed and
# SharpMUSH may not. Alice, who controls none of them, does the moving, so a look shows names alone.
::case rx.setup  a zone master room, a room zoned to it, and rooms to reach
::login wiz Wiz wizpass
::login alice Alice alicepass
::as wiz
think set(me,RXHOME:[loc(*Alice)])
@force [loc(*Alice)]=@dolist RXZone RXHere RXThere RXLocal RXElsewhere=@dig ##
::settle
@force [loc(*Alice)]=@lock/zone [lsearch(all,name,RXZone)]==*Alice
@force [loc(*Alice)]=@open RXGate=[lsearch(all,name,RXThere)],,[lsearch(all,name,RXZone)]
@force [loc(*Alice)]=@open RXGoto=[lsearch(all,name,RXThere)],,[lsearch(all,name,RXZone)]
@force [loc(*Alice)]=@open RXShadow=[lsearch(all,name,RXThere)],,[lsearch(all,name,RXZone)]
@force [loc(*Alice)]=@open RXShadow=[lsearch(all,name,RXLocal)],,[lsearch(all,name,RXHere)]
@force [loc(*Alice)]=@open RXGlobal=[lsearch(all,name,RXElsewhere)],,[config(master_room)]
::settle
@chzone [lsearch(all,name,RXHere)]=[lsearch(all,name,RXZone)]

::case rx.zone-exit  typing a zone master room's exit takes it
::as wiz
@tel *Alice=[lsearch(all,name,RXHere)]
::as alice
RXGate
think [name(loc(me))]

::case rx.zone-goto  goto takes a zone master room's exit
::as wiz
@tel *Alice=[lsearch(all,name,RXHere)]
::as alice
goto RXGoto
think [name(loc(me))]

::case rx.zone-shadow  the room's own exit wins over the zone's exit of the same name
::as wiz
@tel *Alice=[lsearch(all,name,RXHere)]
::as alice
RXShadow
think [name(loc(me))]

::case rx.global-exit  typing a global exit takes it
::as wiz
@tel *Alice=[lsearch(all,name,RXHere)]
::as alice
RXGlobal
think [name(loc(me))]
::as wiz
@tel *Alice=[v(RXHOME)]
